    ns1:IAO_0000111 "author information section"@en ;
    ns1:IAO_0000112 "The section labelled 'author information' in a typical scientific journal article, e.g. in Takon. Ann Gen Psychiatry. 2011; 10: 25. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3204268/)"@en ;
    ns1:IAO_0000115 "A part of a document about the authors that provides biographical information and may discuss how the authors' professional experiences are relevant to the work described in the document."@en ;
