    ns1:IAO_0000114 ns1:IAO_0000120 ;
    ns1:IAO_0000115 "An isoelectric focusing device is a device in which isoelectric focusing can be performed. An isoelectric focussing device had the function to contain and control the contained environment and transfer electrical energy from a power supply to a separation medium and the charged material to be separated."@en ;
