    ns1:IAO_0000114 ns1:IAO_0000120 ;
    ns1:IAO_0000115 "A thermostatic circulator is a device which cools or heats a circulating liquid. It has the function to contain control the contained environment and transfer energy from or to the circulating liquid"@en ;
