    ns1:IAO_0000116 "Should be linked to a GO process, which will be requested by IEDB team. Along with granzyme B production, should be tied to T cell degranulation"^^xsd:string ;
    ns1:IAO_0000117 "PERSON: Bjoern Peters, Randi Vita"^^xsd:string ;
