    ns1:IAO_0000115 "An algorithm used to assemble individual sequence reads into larger contiguous sequences (contigs).  Assembly details include but are not limited to assembler type (overlap-layout-consensus, deBruijn), assembler version, and any relevant quality control information such as per cent known genes/ESTs captured."@en ;
